write('service-areas/remote-drafting',layout({path:'/service-areas/remote-drafting/',title:'Nationwide Remote Residential Drafting',description:'Remote residential drafting for custom homes, additions, ADUs, garages, remodels, and as-built projects throughout the United States.'},[['Home','/'],['Service Areas','/service-areas/'],['Remote Drafting','/service-areas/remote-drafting/']],`<section class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">Nationwide service</p><h1>Nationwide Remote Residential Drafting</h1><p>Timpson coordinates suitable residential drafting projects throughout the United States when clients and project teams can provide reliable property information, measurements, photographs, surveys, and jurisdiction requirements.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href="/quote/">Request a remote project quote</a><a class="button secondary" href="tel:+14353195311">Call ${phone}</a></div></section><section><h2>How remote drafting works</h2><ol><li>Send the project location, goals, files, and schedule.</li><li>Timpson reviews whether the source information is sufficient.</li><li>Missing measurements or jurisdiction questions are resolved before production.</li><li>Drawings and revisions are coordinated electronically.</li></ol><h2>When local help may be needed</h2><p>Additions, remodels, and as-built work can require field verification. Structural, site, or jurisdiction requirements may also require a local architect, engineer, surveyor, or other professional.</p></section><section><h2>Prepare for a remote quote</h2><div class="link-grid"><a href="/resources/remote-drafting-measurement-guide/">Remote measurement checklist</a><a href="/custom-home-plans/">Custom home plans</a><a href="/garage-adu-addition-plans/">Garages, ADUs &amp; additions</a><a href="/remodel-as-built-drawings/">Remodels &amp; as-builts</a></div></section>`));

